  "details": "1. View the VRChat Home world photo: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4432ea9b-729c-46e3-8eaf-846aa0a37fdd/info\n\n2. Visit the world and look at the advertisement space next to the world mirror on the left, notice it's different.\n\nExpected result: The world picture should match the world, currently the Spookality 2026 Bundle.\n\nActual result: An older world photo from Tanabata Bundle promo from July 3, 2026 to September 4, 2026 is shown on the world page. The yellow cube is missing from the world.\n\nAdditional information: Since the [Creator Guidelines](https://hello.vrchat.com/creator-guidelines) was updated on October 6, 2026, this world may be in violation of the recent new guideline about misleading or deceptive thumbnails:\n\n> Content should accurately represent what a user will experience. Names, tags, descriptions, images, acknowledgements, and previews (including thumbnails) should not be misleading. If your content looks different in VRChat than in the images you've used to showcase it, users may have a negative experience.\n\nNotably, the banners are different and the Jimothy raccoon avatar may or may not be seen.",
